    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00178",
        "explanation": "Doctor gave a bounded home-observation plan with medication and urgent-return triggers.",
        "quote": "规律记录、严格遵医嘱用药不自己调整"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00193",
        "explanation": "Caregiver gave a teach-back of monitoring, medication, follow-up, and emergency triggers.",
        "quote": "大方向我明白了"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "By the end, the family had completed in-person psychiatric follow-up, had a new prescription, knew not to self-adjust medication, had a plan to record intake/weight/sleep/medication, and had emergency triggers for dehydration, GI bleeding, severe vomiting, and self-harm statements. Residual diagnostic uncertainty and incomplete psychological testing were acceptable because follow-up and repeat CBC were arranged.",
